  "pseudocode": "adv_gap = advantage_w - advantage_l\nadv_gap_z = zscore(adv_gap)\nloss_pairs = relu(margin - adv_gap_z)\nweighted_loss = loss_pairs * weight\nfinal_loss = mean(weighted_loss)",
